          { "formalEn": "He is not running.", "naturalEn": "He isn't running.", "notePt": "Isn't = is not." }
        ],
        "tipPt": "Contrações naturais: I'm not, he isn't, they aren't."
      },
      {
        "id": "e03l02-learn-05",
        "type": "phrase_examples",
        "titleEn": "Spelling -ing rules",
        "titlePt": "Regras de ortografia -ing",
        "introPt": "Alguns verbos mudam ao formar -ing.",
        "examples": [
          { "en": "run → running (double n)", "pt": "dobra consoante" },
          { "en": "sit → sitting", "pt": "dobra t" },
          { "en": "write → writing (drop e)", "pt": "remove e" },
          { "en": "play → playing", "pt": "regular" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "e03l02-learn-06",
        "type": "mistake",
        "titlePt": "Erro comum",
        "wrongEn": "Look! He runs. / Right now I work.",
        "rightEn": "Look! He is running. / Right now I am working.",
        "explanationPt": "Com right now / look / at the moment, use Present Continuous, não Simple Present."
      },
      {
        "id": "e03l02-learn-07",
        "type": "review",
